 null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 443464, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 4648, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e57", "type": "text", "x": 65, "y": 862, "width": 1280, "height": 32.400000000000006, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#c2410c", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 451383, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 4731, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "查找 id=35：P1  →  P3（继续导航，不能返回行） →  P6（取得行记录）", "originalText": "查找 id=35：P1  →  P3（继续导航，不能返回行） →  P6（取得行记录）", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "e58", "type": "text", "x": 45, "y": 946, "width": 1200, "height": 31.05, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 459302, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 4814, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "二级索引对照（假设在 name 上建索引）", "originalText": "二级索引对照（假设在 name 上建索引）", "fontSize": 23, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "e59", "type": "text", "x": 45, "y": 988, "width": 1300, "height": 29.700000000000003, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 467221, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 4897, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "内部页：导航键 ＋ 子页号         叶子页：name=杜宇、id=35，不含 email", "originalText": "内部页：导航键 ＋ 子页号         叶子页：name=杜宇、id=35，不含 email", "fontSize": 22, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "e60", "type": "text", "x": 45, "y": 1030, "width": 1330, "height": 27.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 475140, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 4980, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "每个节点对应一个页；叶子按键序双向连接。主键值可以出现在上层，完整行记录不会。", "originalText": "每个节点对应一个页；叶子按键序双向连接。主键值可以出现在上层，完整行记录不会。", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.35}, {"id": "e61", "type": "text", "x": 45, "y": 1070, "width": 1320, "height": 22.950000000000003, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 483059, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 5063, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "概念示意，省略页头、槽位与隐藏字段；最左导航项以最小标记表示，长字段可能使用溢出页。", "originalText": "概念示意，省略页头、槽位与隐藏字段；最左导航项以最小标记表示，长字段可能使用溢出页。", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.35}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff", "gridSize": null}, "files": {}}